  displayName: Depot tube 2
  shortName: Tube 2
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 655  \xB7  Dec 23, 2022"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 2 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 655 (2 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 655 (2022-12-23)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
  photos:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ead594c2c0fadbb47a1d3356f3da7639, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground under the rover, just after the drop
    credit: "WATSON  \xB7  Sol 655  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech/MSSS"
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b5734988fcc58434ca296f801b734a1e, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground after the rover backed away
    credit: "Front Hazcam  \xB7  Sol 658  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech"
  placeByLonLat: 1
  longitude: 77.407847
  latitude: 18.452523
  revealRadius: 4
